---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CloserCta from '../components/CloserCta.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="SELI Wash Co. provides straightforward concrete cleaning for homes and small properties in Duncan, Oklahoma."
>
  <section class="band band-ink page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="display">Local concrete cleaning, kept straightforward.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        {business.name} serves homes and small properties in {business.area.label}{' '}
        with a focused list of concrete cleaning services and clear estimates
        before work begins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="band-head rise">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">How we work</p>
          <h2 class="display">Simple rules for every job.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="band-head-aside">
          You should know the price, the practical requirements, and what result
          to expect before equipment is connected.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards rise">
        <article>
          <h3>A focused service list</h3>
          <p>
            Driveways, sidewalks, walkways, patios, porches, steps, and concrete
            parking areas are the core of the business.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Every estimate checked by hand</h3>
          <p>
            A request starts a conversation. We look at the surface, agree on a
            price and day, and nothing is booked until you approve it.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Surface limits discussed first</h3>
          <p>
            Decorative or fragile finishes may be declined. Oil, rust, paint,
            gum, and deeply embedded stains are assessed before work begins.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Your water and power</h3>
          <p>
            Work requires an outdoor spigot and GFCI-protected outlet within
            about {business.equipment.hoseFeet} feet of the cleaning area.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Clear starting prices</h3>
          <p>
            Published prices are starting points. You receive the final quote
            before work begins, including any travel charge outside Duncan.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>A quieter electric setup</h3>
          <p>
            The electric equipment avoids engine exhaust next to your property
            and is quieter than a petrol-powered unit.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band-paper">
    <div class="wrap approach rise">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
        <h2 class="display">A price before the wash starts.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Send the address, the surface, and a photo if one is easy to take.
          Texting is preferred because photos and details stay together.
        </p>
        <p>
          We confirm access to water and power, discuss staining or surface
          concerns, and give you the price before scheduling the work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CloserCta />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head .eyebrow {
    color: var(--amber);
  }
  .page-head h1 {
    max-width: 24ch;
    margin-block: 0.7rem 1rem;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, var(--s8));
  }
  .page-head .lede {
    color: var(--slate-ltr);
  }
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(270px, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
  }
  .cards article {
    padding: 1.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--hair-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .cards h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: var(--s5);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .cards p {
    color: var(--slate);
    font-size: var(--s2);
  }
  .approach {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .approach .display {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, var(--s7));
  }
</style>
